{"seq":4,"slug":"star-formation","title":"恒星形成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"molecular-cloud-collapse","title":"分子云坍缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation/molecular-cloud-collapse","wordCount":2388,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"protostellar-evolution","title":"原恒星演化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation/protostellar-evolution","wordCount":2560,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"initial-mass-function","title":"初始质量函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation/initial-mass-function","wordCount":2502,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"恒星形成\">恒星形成</h1><p>本章探讨恒星从分子云中诞生的物理过程。恒星形成是将弥散的星际气体转化为致密等离子体球的过程，涉及引力、热力学、磁场、湍流和辐射反馈等多种物理的竞争与协作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心主题\">核心主题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分子云坍缩</strong> — 金斯不稳定性、磁场支撑与耗散、碎裂层级</li>\n<li><strong>原恒星演化</strong> — 吸积过程、原行星盘、外流与喷流</li>\n<li><strong>初始质量函数</strong> — IMF的观测确定、物理成因与普适性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关键时间尺度\">关键时间尺度</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间尺度</th>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自由落体时标</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{ff} = \\sqrt{3\\pi/(32G\\rho)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Gρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>~10⁵ yr（分子云核）</td>\n<td>纯引力坍缩时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声波穿越时标</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s = R/c_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><s